{"i":82,"start_s":379.01,"end_s":389.62,"speaker":"SPEAKER_04","speaker_conf":"low","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"40-megawatt solar plant, able to provide enough energy to power 15,000 homes. And because it floats, it uses less energy than most solar farms because the water acts"}
