{"i":86,"start_s":408.39,"end_s":422.57,"speaker":"SPEAKER_02","speaker_conf":"low","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"Let's transition from fossil fuel economy to a clean, renewable energy economy like electrons produced by solar power. Question"}
