{"i":96,"start_s":476.16,"end_s":481.85,"speaker":"SPEAKER_02","speaker_conf":"high","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"In 2016, plug-in hybrids and fully electric cars made up 37% of"}
{"i":97,"start_s":481.99,"end_s":491.09,"speaker":"SPEAKER_03","speaker_conf":"low","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"the new car sales in Norway. And that's a huge increase over just a couple years. Three years earlier, the electric vehicles, the"}
