{"i":99,"start_s":493.42,"end_s":500.3,"speaker":"SPEAKER_01","speaker_conf":"high","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"accounted for only 6% of Norway's sales, so in a short three years it went from 6% to"}
{"i":100,"start_s":500.3,"end_s":512.05,"speaker":"SPEAKER_02","speaker_conf":"low","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"37%. This growth is a combination of fees on gas and diesel-powered cars and subsidies for electric vehicles. And let's look at what else is"}
